"type":"table","head":["Expressão","Sentido","Exemplo"],"rows":[["keep + -ing","continuar","Keep going."],["keep + adjetivo","manter-se","Keep calm."],["keep a promise","cumprir promessa","She **kept her promise**."],["keep track of","acompanhar","**Keep track of** the data."],["keep up with","acompanhar o ritmo","I can’t **keep up with** the numbers."],["keep someone posted","manter informado","**Keep me posted.**"],["keep an eye on","ficar de olho","I’ll **keep an eye on** it."]],"cap":"keep — sentidos principais"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**keep** = manter. Com *-ing* indica continuação; com adjetivo indica estado; com preposição forma expressões fixas."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Please keep me ___ . (posted)","a":"posted","why":"keep posted."},{"s":"I can’t keep ___ with the numbers. (up)","a":"up","why":"keep up with."},{"s":"She ___ her promise to finish. (keep, past)","a":"kept","why":"past simple."},{"s":"Poverty and poor health ___ . (correlate)","a":"correlate","why":"verbo."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["poverty rate","taxa de pobreza"],["health outcome","resultado de saúde"],["data tracking","monitoramento de dados"],["tracking sheet","planilha de acompanhamento"],["statistical trend","tendência estatística"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["then","Keep","me","posted"],"ans":"Keep me posted then","pt":"Então me mantenha informado."},{"words":["of","the","numbers","Can","you","keep","track"],"ans":"Can you keep track of the numbers","pt":"Você consegue acompanhar os números?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"poverty rate","pos":"word","pt":"taxa de pobreza","ex":"Poverty rate.","expt":"Taxa de pobreza."},{"w":"data tracking","pos":"word","pt":"monitoramento de dados","ex":"Data tracking.","expt":